Problem: Salaries Differences
Platform: StrataScratch | Difficulty: Medium
Window Function Used: None (MAX + CASE pattern)
Key Logic: Use conditional MAX to isolate highest salary per department, subtract to get the difference

-- SOLUTION
SELECT
    ABS(
        MAX(CASE WHEN d.department = 'marketing' THEN e.salary END) -
        MAX(CASE WHEN d.department = 'engineering' THEN e.salary END)
    ) AS salary_difference
FROM db_employee e
JOIN db_dept d ON e.department_id = d.id;
